---
import PolicySection from "./PolicySection.astro";
import { ul } from "./styles";
---

<PolicySection title="Who can see your data">
  <ul class:list={ul}>
    <li>
      The other members of your group see your nickname, the tasks you create and join, the days or weeks you mark done,
      your streaks and your place on the leaderboard. They do not see your e-mail address.
    </li>
    <li>Anyone signed in who has your group's invite link can see the group's name before joining.</li>
    <li>
      A group's owner can hand the group over to another member, who then manages it (renames it, removes members or
      deletes it); the former owner stays in the group as a member.
    </li>
    <li>
      When you leave a group, or its owner removes you, your participation and the days or weeks you marked done in its
      tasks are deleted and the group no longer shows your nickname. Tasks you created stay in the group.
    </li>
    <li>
      Nobody else sees your nickname or your e-mail address in the app; your e-mail address is shown only to you, on the
      settings page.
    </li>
  </ul>
</PolicySection>
